      en: ["Reserve area is 6.5 km².", "The reserve was established in 1991.", "Cliffs are up to 200 m high.", "Hatutu is uninhabited.", "Hatutu petrel breeds here.", "Endemic shrub Sida hatutu grows on the island."],
